## 🚀 How to Run this Tool Locally

### 1. Clone the Workspace
```bash
git clone https://github.com
cd cybersecurity-portfolio/Project-4-IOC-Log-Analyzer
```

### 2. Initialize the Staging Environment
```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 3. Deploy Credentials
Create a private configuration file named `config.py` in the root folder and add your specific CTI key:
```python
API_KEY = "your_actual_api_key_here"
```

### 4. Execute Analysis
Pass your raw data directly into the script pipeline:
```bash
python3 analyzer.py sample_logs.txt
```

